  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734194",
      "title": "Project Setup & Route Setup",
      "sourceHash": "52e065b7ed474313f67a5b522a660c4ade01ac0d47c134c6d0b230632ee36251",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.75,
          "en": "So let's now get started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.75,
          "end": 7.53,
          "en": "And for that we have this demo project as mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.53,
          "end": 10.5,
          "en": "and I do strongly recommend that you go through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.5,
          "end": 11.97,
          "en": "the routing section first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.97,
          "end": 14.04,
          "en": "so that you understand this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.04,
          "end": 16.83,
          "en": "and you understand the code in that project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.83,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "It's almost the same code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 20.91,
          "en": "as we had it at the end of the routing section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "It's just a backend API that was enhanced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 26.19,
          "en": "with those authentication features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.19,
          "end": 31.08,
          "en": "And I added a new AuthForm component and it's styling here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.08,
          "end": 32.67,
          "en": "which we'll use in this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.67,
          "end": 34.89,
          "en": "and a new authentication page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.89,
          "end": 38.43,
          "en": "Though I haven't added any route configuration to lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.43,
          "end": 39.6,
          "en": "to that page yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.6,
          "end": 41.613,
          "en": "We're going to do that together instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.72,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "So once you have that project on your machine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 48.03,
          "en": "once you downloaded it, you should navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.03,
          "end": 49.95,
          "en": "into this backend API folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.95,
          "end": 53.49,
          "en": "and there run \"npm install\" to install all the dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.49,
          "end": 56.673,
          "en": "and then \"npm start\" to start that server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.57,
          "end": 60.87,
          "en": "Then in a separate terminal, because you must keep that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.87,
          "end": 63.21,
          "en": "backend server up and running in order to be able to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.21,
          "end": 64.62,
          "en": "communicate with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.62,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "In a separate terminal window",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 69.45,
          "en": "you navigate into your front and application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.45,
          "end": 72.27,
          "en": "And there you must also install all the dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.27,
          "end": 74.31,
          "en": "and then you can start the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.31,
          "end": 77.03999999999999,
          "en": "with \"npm start\" there as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.03999999999999,
          "end": 79.11,
          "en": "And now we can start writing some code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.11,
          "end": 81.99,
          "en": "You should then see a page that looks something like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.99,
          "end": 82.82300000000001,
          "en": "by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 83.7,
          "end": 85.38,
          "en": "So now we can start writing some code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 85.38,
          "end": 87.96000000000001,
          "en": "And as a first step, I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.96000000000001,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "that we have a way of going to that authentication page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 95.1,
          "en": "maybe for a \"/auth\" route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 97.56,
          "en": "And of course, feel free to implement this on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.56,
          "end": 99.69,
          "en": "as a small little practice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 99.69,
          "end": 102.42,
          "en": "I'll take a short pause here to let you pause the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 102.42,
          "end": 103.95,
          "en": "and implement this on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 103.95,
          "end": 106.263,
          "en": "And then thereafter we'll do it together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.11,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "So let's now implement this together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 114.50999999999999,
          "en": "For this of course, we go to App.js where we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 114.50999999999999,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "all these route definitions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 118.68,
          "en": "And here I want to add a new route definition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 118.68,
          "end": 120.93,
          "en": "for this auth route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 124.05,
          "en": "Now the auth route should still be part of my route layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 124.05,
          "end": 127.26,
          "en": "I still want to have that navigation on top of it and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 127.26,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "So therefore, it will be a sibling route to this homepage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 134.28,
          "en": "and to this entire route stack of my events routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 134.28,
          "end": 136.65,
          "en": "We could add it here, maybe in front of the newsletter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 136.65,
          "end": 139.05,
          "en": "though the exact position doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 139.05,
          "end": 141.3,
          "en": "The path will be \"'auth'\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 141.3,
          "end": 144.78,
          "en": "You could also add \"/auth\" as this doesn't clash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.78,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "with the parent path, but a relative path will do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 152.73,
          "en": "And then the element is the \"AuthenticationPage\" component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.73,
          "end": 154.82999999999998,
          "en": "this JSX code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 154.82999999999998,
          "end": 156.96,
          "en": "And for that you also must import the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 156.96,
          "end": 158.643,
          "en": "AuthenticationPage, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 159.63,
          "end": 161.4,
          "en": "Now that's all you have to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.4,
          "end": 164.228,
          "en": "And with that, we should be able to visit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 164.228,
          "end": 168.963,
          "en": "\"localhost.3000/auth\" and see this authentication for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 170.19,
          "end": 172.56,
          "en": "Of course, it would also be nice to have an entry here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.56,
          "end": 175.17000000000002,
          "en": "in the main navigation, and therefore I'll go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.17000000000002,
          "end": 177.73,
          "en": "to my MainNavigation component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.62,
          "end": 183.12,
          "en": "and in there I'll simply copy that newsletter list item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 183.12,
          "end": 186.24,
          "en": "and add a new nav link to /auth",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.24,
          "end": 189.09,
          "en": "which also should get this Active clause if it is active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 189.09,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "So I'll keep that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 194.04,
          "en": "Give this a caption of \"Authentication\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.04,
          "end": 196.35,
          "en": "And with that, of course we do have this new entry here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 196.35,
          "end": 200.1,
          "en": "and we can go to this page through our navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.1,
          "end": 201.32999999999998,
          "en": "That's of course, nothing new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 201.32999999999998,
          "end": 204.3,
          "en": "but that is how we get started with adding authentication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 204.3,
          "end": 206.463,
          "en": "Now we can reach this auth form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.48,
          "end": 208.71,
          "en": "Now as a next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 208.71,
          "end": 212.94,
          "en": "before we actually start adding authentication logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212.94,
          "end": 217.772,
          "en": "I wanna dive into an additional routing concept that allows",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 217.772,
          "end": 221.19,
          "en": "us to improve the user experience in this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 221.19,
          "end": 224.19299999999998,
          "en": "And that fits really well into this core section here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
